From 07f387e4a14c95b16d44a23fa06b335ebca9379e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 13:34:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Use the surfer photo for the signed-in Home hero

Swaps the signed-in hero's background from the stilt-fishermen photo
to a new shot of a surfer riding a wave off Sri Lanka's south coast,
per Pradas's pick. Keeps signed-out Landing on the stilt-fishermen
photo, so signed-in vs signed-out now have distinct hero imagery by
design rather than by accident.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
